{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0a59aa9dc5a833d8b73","chatId":"cb15c8e13c3140d7982cc2f538250c95","sessionId":null,"userId":98327,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"D\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"D\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1274,"promptTokens":1614,"completionTokens":74,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:01"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.003592379789795488,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0a59aa9dc5a833d8b72","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482341243,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:01","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0a59aa9dc5a833d8b72","chatId":"cb15c8e13c3140d7982cc2f538250c95","sessionId":null,"userId":98327,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小拉的生日要来了，我给她买了一个娃娃作为惊喜。她提前两天来到我家，但我忘了把床头柜上的礼物藏起来了。小拉看到以后大笑，说这个娃娃很丑，还开玩笑说不知道谁会花钱买这种娃娃。我跟她说，说不定会有人觉得这是一个不错的礼物呢，她不同意。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，我最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 开心 & 害怕\nB) 害怕 & 期待\nC) 尴尬 & 失望\nD) 失望 & 期待\nE) 失望 & 开心\nF) 尴尬 & 期待\n\n## 问题 2\n我为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 小拉不喜欢我送给她的生日礼物 & 我知道小拉不喜欢玩偶\nB) 小拉说我给她买的礼物很丑 & 我很高兴小拉喜欢我的礼物\nC) 小拉两天前来我家拜访，那是在她生日之前 & 我很高兴小拉喜欢我的礼物\nD) 小拉说我给她买的礼物很丑 & 小拉不喜欢我送给她的生日礼物\nE) 小拉说我给她买的礼物很丑 & 我想让小拉知道我为她准备了什么礼物\nF) 小拉两天前来我家拜访，那是在她生日之前 & 我知道小拉不喜欢玩偶","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.003592379789795488,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0a59aa9dc5a833d8b73","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482341241,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:01","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"2eddeda44fb34cd0bff5d0e48761bc22"}